Title page Software title: BeAvis Car Rental System Team members: Alec,
Vunsh, Gabe, Meshach, Phong

System Description: BeAvis is a car rental company that currently is
using a pen-and-paper rental process for processing their cars. The
purpose of this system is to replace the manual process with a software
system that makes renting vehicles more efficient and convenient.
Embedding this system will smooth the process of renting vehicles, which
is essential to the day-to-day management of the company.

Brief overview of system: The system will be compatible with the latest
version of either iOS or Android. The system will also be able to
integrate easily into websites and applications. Customers will be able
to create an account, locate BeAvis locations, search through BeAvis
vehicle catalogs, make rentals, sign legal rental documents, and log
their information into their account. Within the company, employees will
be able to view customers' requests for rentals, review contracts, view
what cars are available for customers, and update the availability of
the fleet. The primary users that this system will affect are BeAvis
customers and employees. Customers will enjoy a more convenient process
for renting vehicles and interacting with the company. Employees will
have an easy-to-manage system that will allow them to manage customer
information and cars. This will essentially be a centralized system for
employees to access and manage information with customers in an orderly
way, unlike the pen-and-paper process.

