Class relationships: User is the parent class for Customer and Employee,
so both share the account fields and login operations. A Customer can
make multiple RentalReservations, and each reservation belongs to one
customer. Each reservation is for one Vehicle; the same vehicle may be
used in different reservations over time, but confirmed reservations
cannot overlap. A reservation uses one PaymentMethod, while a customer
may have more than one saved payment method. Each reservation has a
Contract containing the rental agreement and a reference to its stored
document.

